<title>USA: Motorola opens Madrid microcellular center.</title>
<headline>Motorola opens Madrid microcellular center.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc said Wednesday it established an Advanced Network Design and Development Center in Madrid.</p>
<p>The center will initially be responsible for continuing development of the company's microcellular technology for mobile cellular networks, Motorola said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
